WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.560
- So why did you start
performing together?

00:00:02.560 --> 00:00:03.393
- Why not?

00:00:03.393 --> 00:00:04.295
- Why not

00:00:04.295 --> 00:00:05.128
is the thing I guess,
- That's a good question.

00:00:05.128 --> 00:00:05.961
- You know I love singing with her.

00:00:05.961 --> 00:00:07.270
I love being on stage with her,

00:00:07.270 --> 00:00:09.610
and I had just done Annie on Broadway

00:00:09.610 --> 00:00:10.480
and at studio.

00:00:10.480 --> 00:00:11.313
- [Kate] Please clap.

00:00:11.313 --> 00:00:12.281
