for a couple of nights?

00:00:25.750 --> 00:00:27.050
And I was like, yeah.

00:00:27.050 --> 00:00:29.640
So I called Kate and said,
you're doing an act with me.

00:00:29.640 --> 00:00:30.473
(Kelly laughs)

00:00:30.473 --> 00:00:32.014
So that's how it started.
- [Kelly] She didn't ask,

00:00:32.014 --> 00:00:32.847
- [Jane] I didn't ask,
- [Kelly] She didn't ask,

00:00:32.847 --> 00:00:33.680
- just told her.
- So what,

00:00:33.680 --> 00:00:34.513
- [Kelly] You're doing this Thursday

00:00:34.513 --> 00:00:35.346
