00:00:52.330 --> 00:00:54.230
And I think it should
be the name of the show.

00:00:54.230 --> 00:00:55.140
It just happened that fast.

00:00:55.140 --> 00:00:56.110
- We are kinda like two lost souls.

00:00:56.110 --> 00:00:57.270
- We are like two lost souls

00:00:57.270 --> 00:00:58.950
on the highway of life.
- Yeah, yeah, right.

00:00:58.950 --> 00:00:59.783
- Yeah.

00:00:59.783 --> 00:01:01.074
- We got each other.

00:01:01.074 --> 00:01:01.907
- I love the highway of life.

00:01:01.907 --> 00:01:02.740
- We do this, I do this.

00:01:02.740 --> 00:01:04.157
